msgctxt "Tooltip displayed when hovering over the CKEditor 5 icon, providing information about AI assistance."
msgid "AI Agent"
msgstr "وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"

msgctxt "Hint suggesting users utilize AI for documenting or content creation."
msgid "Type / to request AI content"
msgstr "اكتب / لطلب محتوى الذكاء الاصطناعي"

msgctxt "Appears when the Browser does not support readable streams."
msgid "Browser does not support readable streams"
msgstr "المتصفح لا يدعم التدفقات القابلة للقراءة"

msgctxt "Indicates a failure during a network call."
msgid "We couldn't connect to the AI. Please check your internet"
msgstr "تعذر الاتصال بالذكاء الاصطناعي. يرجى التحقق من اتصال الإنترنت"

msgctxt "Appears when an unsupported language code is provided."
msgid "Unsupported language code"
msgstr "رمز اللغة غير مدعوم"

msgctxt "Invalid moderation response format"
msgid "Invalid moderation response format"
msgstr "تنسيق استجابة الإشراف غير صالح"

msgctxt "I'm sorry, but I cannot assist with that request."
msgid "I'm sorry, but I cannot assist with that request."
msgstr "عذرًا، لا أستطيع المساعدة في هذا الطلب."

msgctxt "Cancel Generation"
msgid "Cancel Generation"
msgstr "إلغاء التوليد"

msgctxt "Slash Command: Open the AI Command Menu in an Empty Field"
msgid "Slash Command: Open the AI Command Menu in an Empty Field"
msgstr "أمر الشريط المائل: افتح قائمة أوامر الذكاء الاصطناعي في حقل فارغ"

msgctxt "Force Insert Slash Command: Add a Slash Command Within Existing Text"
msgid "Force Insert Slash Command: Add a Slash Command Within Existing Text"
msgstr "فرض إدخال أمر الشريط المائل: إضافة أمر شريط مائل داخل النص الحالي"

msgctxt "Cancel AI Generation"
msgid "Cancel AI Generation"
msgstr "إلغاء توليد الذكاء الاصطناعي"

msgctxt "Submit"
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "إرسال"

msgctxt "Ask AI to edit"
msgid "Ask AI to edit"
msgstr "اطلب من الذكاء الاصطناعي التحرير"

msgctxt "Continue: The server has received the request headers and the client should proceed to send the request body."
msgid "Continue: The server has received the request headers and the client should proceed to send the request body."
msgstr "متابعة: تلقى الخادم رؤوس الطلب، وعلى العميل متابعة إرسال جسم الطلب."

msgctxt "Switching Protocols: The server is switching protocols according to the Upgrade header."
msgid "Switching Protocols: The server is switching protocols according to the Upgrade header."
msgstr "تبديل البروتوكولات: يقوم الخادم بتبديل البروتوكولات وفقًا لرأس الترقية."

msgctxt "Processing: The server has received and is processing the request, but no response is available yet."
msgid "Processing: The server has received and is processing the request, but no response is available yet."
msgstr "المعالجة: تلقى الخادم الطلب وهو قيد المعالجة، لكن لا توجد استجابة متاحة حتى الآن."

msgctxt "Early Hints: Used to return some response headers before final HTTP message."
msgid "Early Hints: Used to return some response headers before final HTTP message."
msgstr "تلميحات مبكرة: تُستخدم لإرجاع بعض رؤوس الاستجابة قبل الرسالة النهائية لـ HTTP."

msgctxt "The request has succeeded."
msgid "The request has succeeded."
msgstr "تم تنفيذ الطلب بنجاح."

msgctxt "The request has been fulfilled and resulted in a new resource being created."
msgid "The request has been fulfilled and resulted in a new resource being created."
msgstr "تم تنفيذ الطلب وتم إنشاء مورد جديد."

msgctxt "The request has been accepted for processing, but the processing has not been completed."
msgid "The request has been accepted for processing, but the processing has not been completed."
msgstr "تم قبول الطلب للمعالجة، لكن المعالجة لم تكتمل بعد."

msgctxt "The server successfully processed the request, but is returning information from another source."
msgid "The server successfully processed the request, but is returning information from another source."
msgstr "عالج الخادم الطلب بنجاح، لكنه يعيد معلومات من مصدر آخر."

msgctxt "The server successfully processed the request, but is not returning any content."
msgid "The server successfully processed the request, but is not returning any content."
msgstr "عالج الخادم الطلب بنجاح، لكنه لا يعيد أي محتوى."

msgctxt "The server successfully processed the request, but is not returning any content. The user agent should reset the document view."
msgid "The server successfully processed the request, but is not returning any content. The user agent should reset the document view."
msgstr "عالج الخادم الطلب بنجاح، لكنه لا يعيد أي محتوى. يجب على وكيل المستخدم إعادة ضبط عرض المستند."

msgctxt "The server has fulfilled the partial GET request for the resource."
msgid "The server has fulfilled the partial GET request for the resource."
msgstr "نفذ الخادم طلب GET الجزئي للمورد."

msgctxt "The response from the server contains multiple status codes, each with its own set of headers and body."
msgid "The response from the server contains multiple status codes, each with its own set of headers and body."
msgstr "تحتوي استجابة الخادم على أكواد حالة متعددة، كل منها يحتوي على مجموعة رؤوس وجسم خاص به."

msgctxt "The server has encountered a previous condition and is applying it to this current request."
msgid "The server has encountered a previous condition and is applying it to this current request."
msgstr "واجه الخادم شرطًا سابقًا ويطبقه على الطلب الحالي."

msgctxt "The server has fulfilled a GET request for the resource, and the response is a representation of the result of one or more instance-manipulations applied to the current instance."
msgid "The server has fulfilled a GET request for the resource, and the response is a representation of the result of one or more instance-manipulations applied to the current instance."
msgstr "نفذ الخادم طلب GET للمورد، والاستجابة تمثل نتيجة واحدة أو أكثر من التعديلات التي تم تطبيقها على المثيل الحالي."

msgctxt "The server has multiple options for the requested resource."
msgid "The server has multiple options for the requested resource."
msgstr "لدى الخادم خيارات متعددة للمورد المطلوب."

msgctxt "The requested resource has been permanently moved to a new location."
msgid "The requested resource has been permanently moved to a new location."
msgstr "تم نقل المورد المطلوب بشكل دائم إلى موقع جديد."

msgctxt "The requested resource has been found, but it has been temporarily moved to a different location."
msgid "The requested resource has been found, but it has been temporarily moved to a different location."
msgstr "تم العثور على المورد المطلوب، لكنه نُقل مؤقتًا إلى موقع مختلف."

msgctxt "The response to the request can be found under a different URI and should be retrieved using a GET method on that resource."
msgid "The response to the request can be found under a different URI and should be retrieved using a GET method on that resource."
msgstr "يمكن العثور على استجابة الطلب تحت معرف URI مختلف ويجب استرجاعها باستخدام طريقة GET على هذا المورد."

msgctxt "The requested resource has not been modified since the last request. It is still valid from the server's cache."
msgid "The requested resource has not been modified since the last request. It is still valid from the server's cache."
msgstr "لم يتم تعديل المورد المطلوب منذ الطلب الأخير. لا يزال صالحًا من ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للخادم."

msgctxt "The requested resource must be accessed through the proxy given by the Location field."
msgid "The requested resource must be accessed through the proxy given by the Location field."
msgstr "يجب الوصول إلى المورد المطلوب عبر الوكيل المحدد في حقل الموقع."

msgctxt "The requested resource has been temporarily moved to a different location, and the client should continue to use the same method for future requests."
msgid "The requested resource has been temporarily moved to a different location, and the client should continue to use the same method for future requests."
msgstr "تم نقل المورد المطلوب مؤقتًا إلى موقع مختلف، ويجب على العميل متابعة استخدام نفس الطريقة للطلبات المستقبلية."

msgctxt "The requested resource has been permanently moved to a different location, and the client should use the new URI for all future requests."
msgid "The requested resource has been permanently moved to a different location, and the client should use the new URI for all future requests."
msgstr "تم نقل المورد المطلوب بشكل دائم إلى موقع مختلف، ويجب على العميل استخدام معرف URI الجديد لجميع الطلبات المستقبلية."

msgctxt "The server could not understand the request due to invalid syntax."
msgid "The server could not understand the request due to invalid syntax."
msgstr "تعذر على الخادم فهم الطلب بسبب بناء جملة غير صالح."

msgctxt "The request requires user authentication."
msgid "The request requires user authentication."
msgstr "يتطلب الطلب مصادقة المستخدم."

msgctxt "Payment is required to fulfill the request."
msgid "Payment is required to fulfill the request."
msgstr "يلزم الدفع لتلبية الطلب."

msgctxt "Access to the requested resource is forbidden."
msgid "Access to the requested resource is forbidden."
msgstr "الوصول إلى المورد المطلوب محظور."

msgctxt "The server could not find the requested resource."
msgid "The server could not find the requested resource."
msgstr "تعذر على الخادم العثور على المورد المطلوب."

msgctxt "The request method is not allowed for the requested resource."
msgid "The request method is not allowed for the requested resource."
msgstr "طريقة الطلب غير مسموح بها للمورد المطلوب."

msgctxt "The server cannot generate content that is acceptable according to the Accept headers sent in the request."
msgid "The server cannot generate content that is acceptable according to the Accept headers sent in the request."
msgstr "لا يمكن للخادم إنشاء محتوى مقبول وفقًا لرؤوس Accept المرسلة في الطلب."

msgctxt "Proxy authentication is required to access the requested resource."
msgid "Proxy authentication is required to access the requested resource."
msgstr "تتطلب المصادقة عبر الوكيل للوصول إلى المورد المطلوب."

msgctxt "The server timed out waiting for the request."
msgid "The server timed out waiting for the request."
msgstr "انتهت مهلة الخادم أثناء انتظار الطلب."

msgctxt "Conflict detected. The request could not be completed due to a conflict with the current state of the resource."
msgid "Conflict detected. The request could not be completed due to a conflict with the current state of the resource."
msgstr "تم اكتشاف تعارض. تعذر إتمام الطلب بسبب تعارض مع الحالة الحالية للمورد."

msgctxt "Gone. The requested resource is no longer available and will not be available again."
msgid "Gone. The requested resource is no longer available and will not be available again."
msgstr "ذهب. المورد المطلوب لم يعد متاحًا ولن يكون متاحًا مرة أخرى."

msgctxt "Length required. The server requires a Content-Length header to be included in the request."
msgid "Length required. The server requires a Content-Length header to be included in the request."
msgstr "الطول مطلوب. يتطلب الخادم تضمين رأس Content-Length في الطلب."

msgctxt "Precondition failed. One or more conditions specified in the request headers evaluated to false when tested on the server."
msgid "Precondition failed. One or more conditions specified in the request headers evaluated to false when tested on the server."
msgstr "فشل شرط مسبق. واحد أو أكثر من الشروط المحددة في رؤوس الطلب قيمت بأنها خاطئة عند اختبارها على الخادم."

msgctxt "Payload too large. The server refuses to process the request because the payload is larger than the server is willing or able to process."
msgid "Payload too large. The server refuses to process the request because the payload is larger than the server is willing or able to process."
msgstr "الحمولة كبيرة جدًا. يرفض الخادم معالجة الطلب لأن الحمولة أكبر مما يمكنه معالجته أو قبوله."

msgctxt "URI too long. The server refuses to process the request because the URI is longer than the server is willing to interpret."
msgid "URI too long. The server refuses to process the request because the URI is longer than the server is willing to interpret."
msgstr "عنوان URI طويل جدًا. يرفض الخادم معالجة الطلب لأن العنوان أطول مما يمكنه تفسيره."

msgctxt "Unsupported media type. The server refuses to process the request because the media type is not supported."
msgid "Unsupported media type. The server refuses to process the request because the media type is not supported."
msgstr "نوع الوسائط غير مدعوم. يرفض الخادم معالجة الطلب لأن نوع الوسائط غير مدعوم."

msgctxt "Range not satisfiable. The server cannot fulfill the request because the client has asked for a portion of the file that cannot be provided."
msgid "Range not satisfiable. The server cannot fulfill the request because the client has asked for a portion of the file that cannot be provided."
msgstr "النطاق غير قابل للإرضاء. لا يمكن للخادم تلبية الطلب لأن العميل طلب جزءًا من الملف لا يمكن توفيره."

msgctxt "Expectation failed. The server is unable to meet the requirements specified by the Expect request header field."
msgid "Expectation failed. The server is unable to meet the requirements specified by the Expect request header field."
msgstr "فشل التوقع. لا يمكن للخادم تلبية المتطلبات المحددة في حقل رأس الطلب Expect."

msgctxt "I'm a teapot. The server refuses to brew coffee because it is, permanently and intentionally, a teapot."
msgid "I'm a teapot. The server refuses to brew coffee because it is, permanently and intentionally, a teapot."
msgstr "أنا إبريق شاي. يرفض الخادم تحضير القهوة لأنه إبريق شاي بشكل دائم ومتعمد."

msgctxt "Misdirected request. The request was directed at a server that is not able to produce a response."
msgid "Misdirected request. The request was directed at a server that is not able to produce a response."
msgstr "طلب موجه بشكل خاطئ. تم توجيه الطلب إلى خادم غير قادر على تقديم استجابة."

msgctxt "Unprocessable entity. The server understands the content type of the request entity but cannot process the contained instructions."
msgid "Unprocessable entity. The server understands the content type of the request entity but cannot process the contained instructions."
msgstr "كيان غير قابل للمعالجة. يفهم الخادم نوع محتوى الكيان المطلوب لكنه لا يستطيع معالجة التعليمات المضمنة."

msgctxt "Locked. The requested resource is locked and can only be accessed by the client that locked it."
msgid "Locked. The requested resource is locked and can only be accessed by the client that locked it."
msgstr "مغلق. المورد المطلوب مغلق ولا يمكن الوصول إليه إلا من قبل العميل الذي قام بقفله."

msgctxt "Failed dependency. The request failed because it depended on another request and that request failed."
msgid "Failed dependency. The request failed because it depended on another request and that request failed."
msgstr "اعتماد فاشل. فشل الطلب لأنه يعتمد على طلب آخر وفشل ذلك الطلب."

msgctxt "Too early. The server is unwilling to risk processing a request that might be replayed."
msgid "Too early. The server is unwilling to risk processing a request that might be replayed."
msgstr "مبكر جدًا. لا يرغب الخادم في المخاطرة بمعالجة طلب قد يتم تكراره."

msgctxt "Upgrade required. The client should switch to a different protocol."
msgid "Upgrade required. The client should switch to a different protocol."
msgstr "الترقية مطلوبة. يجب على العميل التبديل إلى بروتوكول مختلف."

msgctxt "Precondition required. The origin server requires the request to be conditional."
msgid "Precondition required. The origin server requires the request to be conditional."
msgstr "شرط مسبق مطلوب. يتطلب الخادم الأصلي أن يكون الطلب مشروطًا."

msgctxt "Too many requests. The user has sent too many requests in a given amount of time."
msgid "Too many requests. The user has sent too many requests in a given amount of time."
msgstr "طلبات كثيرة جدًا. أرسل المستخدم عددًا كبيرًا جدًا من الطلبات في وقت معين."

msgctxt "Request header fields too large. The server is unwilling to process the request because its header fields are too large."
msgid "Request header fields too large. The server is unwilling to process the request because its header fields are too large."
msgstr "حقول رؤوس الطلب كبيرة جدًا. لا يرغب الخادم في معالجة الطلب لأن حقوله كبيرة جدًا."

msgctxt "Unavailable for legal reasons. The server is denying access to the resource as a consequence of a legal demand."
msgid "Unavailable for legal reasons. The server is denying access to the resource as a consequence of a legal demand."
msgstr "غير متاح لأسباب قانونية. يرفض الخادم الوصول إلى المورد نتيجة طلب قانوني."

msgctxt "Internal Server Error. The server encountered an unexpected condition that prevented it from fulfilling the request."
msgid "Internal Server Error. The server encountered an unexpected condition that prevented it from fulfilling the request."
msgstr "خطأ في الخادم الداخلي. واجه الخادم حالة غير متوقعة منعته من تلبية الطلب."

msgctxt "Not Implemented. The server does not support the functionality required to fulfill the request."
msgid "Not Implemented. The server does not support the functionality required to fulfill the request."
msgstr "لم يتم التنفيذ. لا يدعم الخادم الوظيفة المطلوبة لتلبية الطلب."

msgctxt "Bad Gateway. The server, while acting as a gateway or proxy, received an invalid response from the upstream server it accessed in attempting to fulfill the request."
msgid "Bad Gateway. The server, while acting as a gateway or proxy, received an invalid response from the upstream server it accessed in attempting to fulfill the request."
msgstr "بوابة غير صالحة. أثناء عمله كبوابة أو وكيل، تلقى الخادم استجابة غير صالحة من الخادم الأعلى عند محاولة تلبية الطلب."

msgctxt "Service Unavailable. The server is currently unable to handle the request due to temporary overloading or maintenance of the server."
msgid "Service Unavailable. The server is currently unable to handle the request due to temporary overloading or maintenance of the server."
msgstr "الخدمة غير متاحة. لا يمكن للخادم حاليًا التعامل مع الطلب بسبب التحميل المؤقت الزائد أو صيانة الخادم."

msgctxt "Gateway Timeout. The server, while acting as a gateway or proxy, did not receive a timely response from the upstream server it accessed in attempting to fulfill the request."
msgid "Gateway Timeout. The server, while acting as a gateway or proxy, did not receive a timely response from the upstream server it accessed in attempting to fulfill the request."
msgstr "مهلة البوابة. أثناء عمله كبوابة أو وكيل، لم يتلقَ الخادم استجابة في الوقت المناسب من الخادم الأعلى عند محاولة تلبية الطلب."

msgctxt "HTTP Version Not Supported. The server does not support the HTTP protocol version used in the request."
msgid "HTTP Version Not Supported. The server does not support the HTTP protocol version used in the request."
msgstr "إصدار HTTP غير مدعوم. لا يدعم الخادم إصدار بروتوكول HTTP المستخدم في الطلب."

msgctxt "Variant Also Negotiates. Transparent content negotiation for the request results in a circular reference."
msgid "Variant Also Negotiates. Transparent content negotiation for the request results in a circular reference."
msgstr "التفاوض على البديل. يؤدي التفاوض على محتوى شفاف للطلب إلى مرجع دائري."

msgctxt "Insufficient Storage. The server is unable to store the representation needed to complete the request."
msgid "Insufficient Storage. The server is unable to store the representation needed to complete the request."
msgstr "سعة تخزين غير كافية. لا يستطيع الخادم تخزين التمثيل المطلوب لإكمال الطلب."

msgctxt "Loop Detected. The server detected an infinite loop while processing the request."
msgid "Loop Detected. The server detected an infinite loop while processing the request."
msgstr "تم الكشف عن حلقة متكررة. اكتشف الخادم حلقة لانهائية أثناء معالجة الطلب."

msgctxt "Not Extended. Further extensions to the request are required for the server to fulfill it."
msgid "Not Extended. Further extensions to the request are required for the server to fulfill it."
msgstr "غير ممتد. هناك حاجة إلى مزيد من الامتدادات للطلب ليتمكن الخادم من تلبيته."

msgctxt "Network Authentication Required. The client needs to authenticate to gain network access."
msgid "Network Authentication Required. The client needs to authenticate to gain network access."
msgstr "تتطلب المصادقة على الشبكة. يحتاج العميل إلى المصادقة للوصول إلى الشبكة."

msgctxt "Edit or review"
msgid "Edit or review"
msgstr "تحرير أو مراجعة"

msgctxt "Improve Writing"
msgid "Improve Writing"
msgstr "تحسين الكتابة"

msgctxt "Make Shorter"
msgid "Make Shorter"
msgstr "اجعلها أقصر"

msgctxt "Make Longer"
msgid "Make Longer"
msgstr "اجعلها أطول"

msgctxt "Simplify Language"
msgid "Simplify Language"
msgstr "تبسيط اللغة"

msgctxt "Generate from selection"
msgid "Generate from selection"
msgstr "إنشاء من التحديد"

msgctxt "Summarize"
msgid "Summarize"
msgstr "تلخيص"

msgctxt "Continue"
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "متابعة"

msgctxt "Error message shown when the AI model returns an empty response"
msgid "Empty response from AI model"
msgstr "استجابة فارغة من نموذج الذكاء الاصطناعي"

msgctxt "Invalid AI model specified. Available models"
msgid "Invalid AI model specified. Available models"
msgstr "تم تحديد نموذج AI غير صالح. النماذج المتاحة"